;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\幸太郎の部屋.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "T" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Fifteen minutes into the search.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Plenty of time for the two of us to go through everything.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I went through <STYLE ID="1">Kana's</STYLE> desk, and <STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE> through the closet, but...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hmm, not even </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Daddy's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> dirty magazines or dirty DVDs are turning up... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I guess it's all online these days."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Are <STYLE ID="2">Dad</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="3">Grandma</STYLE> innocent after all?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That would be good news, but it doesn't mean they're cleared of suspicion yet.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All we know is it isn't in this room, and there are plenty of other places to search.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, why don't you take a bath?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Your clothes really stink of the storehouse."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... Do I smell?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I held my sleeve to my nose.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I caught a faint smell, something like mold, something like dust.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE>, with her keen eyes, nose, and ears, can probably pick up the smell even from a little way off.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... Maybe I'll change. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Sorry, but </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, could you tidy up the closet?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Aww? That's a pain..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... The one who searched the closet was </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　Everything has to go back where it was. I'm counting on you."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Okaaay..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ふすま.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\キオク\夏菜の部屋.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "4" "2000" "960" "1" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
This was the room I used when I lived in Arata.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's still kept as my room, but <STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE> will end up using it before long.<PG>
I pulled some clothes, whatever came to hand, out of a cardboard box.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd like a bath, but I might get dirty again, so that can wait.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Huh? In that case... is there any point in changing?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Once I'm back in the storehouse, the fresh clothes will pick up the smell too.<PG>
I put the clothes I'd pulled out back in the box.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I don't like being dirty, but given what I'm doing right now, I'll have to put up with a little.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Tonight I'll surely be told to eat dinner at home, so I'll take care of the bath and changing then.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Besides, I don't want to sit down to dinner in front of everyone looking grubby.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ふすま.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\幸太郎の部屋.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "4" "2000" "960" "1" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
When I got back to the room, <STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE> was glancing restlessly around.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The things she'd taken out of the closet still hadn't been put away.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, all this stuff―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "200" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜手前バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"Shh! Quiet!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\夏菜見上げる.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
A curt reply that cut me off, then a fixed <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="にら">glare</STYLE> at the ceiling from <STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As if chasing a mosquito in midair, her eyes even seemed to be following something I couldn't see.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">it still smells..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... I haven't changed yet. My clothes might just get dirty again..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"No! Even after you left the room, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, it kept smelling of the storehouse!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"It's in this room―the thing you're looking for, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Don't tell me <STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE> sniffed out the smell of the books?<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Abyss～深淵に至る窓～.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"It's been weird since yesterday. This room smelled a little moldy. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I figured it was because </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> went all over the place getting ready for the thirteenth-year memorial service, but this smell is the same as that storehouse."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\夏菜見上げる.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE> kept staring at the ceiling.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... The space above the ceiling...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Probably..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, get on my shoulders."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\幸太郎の部屋天井.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I put <STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE> on my shoulders and had her feel around the ceiling.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\ノック.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE> sniffed and sniffed, and knocked on the ceiling, tap, tap.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\ノック.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
To look at, they were perfectly ordinary ceiling boards, but...<PG>
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\ノック重い.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　The sound's different only here. See, there's something up there."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\ノック重い.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
Only where <STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE> <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="たた">knocked</STYLE> was the sound a little heavier.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... Is there a seam in the board? Can it be opened?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hmm... No seam at all. I don't think it opens."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... Then maybe you can get above the ceiling from somewhere else?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Maybe there's a secret window in the roof?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\幸太郎の部屋.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... With </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Dad's</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> build, climbing onto the second-floor roof is out of the question. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Somewhere in the second-floor rooms, there must be a space that leads above this ceiling."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜手を上げるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"Okay! Now this is turning into a real investigation!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE> was delighted, but has she forgotten that the one being investigated is <STYLE ID="2">her own father</STYLE>...?<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, you check here and the guest room. I'll check the hallway and the other rooms."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Okay, okaaay!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Before that, though, put the closet back in order."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"Tch..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階廊下.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
First, the second-floor hallway.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Everyone passes through here all the time, so if anything big were off, someone would notice.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And yet...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The ceiling was old and darkened, so if anyone had cut into it, the marks would stand out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\ノック.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
I poked at it with a broom, but these weren't boards that would come loose easily.<PG>
Let me try the next room.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\三畳間昼.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
This room usually sits empty.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's a cramped little three-mat room, where <STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE> used to do her foreseeing long ago.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
How many years has it been since I came in here?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\三畳間押入れ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
A closet built into the cramped room―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I opened it, but there was nothing inside.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Above it was the <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="てんぶくろ">top cupboard</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That should be empty too, but...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ふすま.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "2000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\三畳間天袋.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "強風.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "1000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "1000" "PASS"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
The moment I opened it, I felt the faintest breath of air.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In this sealed room, a draft from a top cupboard that should have been just as sealed...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Don't tell me... back in there...!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At my height, I couldn't see all the way to the back of the top cupboard.<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\death_sound3.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\三畳間昼.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, come here a sec!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"I'm not done tidying yet!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... That can wait!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Jeez, you're such a slave driver..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes, yes, what can I do for you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... Shine this phone into the back of the top cupboard for me. There was a draft coming from in here."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Yeah... it smells..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\三畳間天袋.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE> took my phone and climbed into the top cupboard without even needing my shoulders.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... Well? Can you get above the ceiling?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"No way, no way! This is all one solid board too!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　But this board's really new!? Did someone replace it?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... Can you break it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
