<STYLE ID="13">'In Shiyo 669, the spring after the mass disappearance, we noticed that several dozen unfamiliar cherry trees had appeared around the Arata settlement. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="13">They had suddenly appeared in places where, until the year before, there had been no sign of any tree at all. </STYLE>
