<STYLE ID="13">As if they had bloomed in full every year, the great cherry trees proudly flaunted their blossoms.'</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="13">'The number of cherry trees that suddenly appeared was about 30. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="13">Strangely, it is almost the same as the number of residents who vanished last year.'</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="13">'For our inquiry, we dug up one of the newly grown trees by the roots. </STYLE>
