<STYLE ID="13">These trees are no cherry trees. They are something else, something that looks exactly like a cherry.'</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="13">'Since ancient times, it is said, these cherry-tree-like things that suddenly appear have been called '</STYLE><STYLE ID="14">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">.' </STYLE>
